  "releaseNotes": "Here are the main changes introduced in Lua 5.5.\n\t\t\tIts main new features are declarations for global variables, named vararg tables, more compact arrays, and major garbage collections done incrementally.\n\t\t\tSee: https://www.lua.org/manual/5.5/readme.html#changes\n\t\t\tThe reference manual lists the incompatibilities that had to be introduced: https://www.lua.org/manual/5.5/manual.html#8",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Lua is a powerful, fast, lightweight, embeddable scripting language.",
  "title": "Lua",
